  "scope": "Limited manual assessment of 24 named hash-verified views from 40 captures. Hip 90-degree single-axis diagnostic poses only; full geometry remains visible.",
  "observations": [
    "Eight fixed camera azimuths were captured per hip for each exact candidate with the verified corrective morph weights active.",
    "Paired inner-hip views (left orbit 1 and right orbit 3) still show pinched, abrupt transitions; no convincing visible improvement is evident at the captured scale despite lower measured contacts and a better selected-edge fold proxy.",
    "Outer/rear paired views likewise show no clear shape improvement. Some views are blocked by the arms or legs, and current right orbit 4 is completely obscured.",
    "The objective was optimized on only 12 measured edges per hip and is not independent proof of broader anatomical improvement. These captures do not qualify game animations or appearance."
  ],
  "decision": "Retain the candidate and target as unqualified diagnostic evidence, with no selection or publication. Investigate broader surface shape and independent visual metrics; do not treat optimized fold proxy or contact count as an anatomy pass.",
